\item[S2] Dave Auckly, \emph{Folklore, the Borromean rings, the icosahedron, and three dimensions} (2020), arXiv:2009.09836v1, ``The Borromean rings'', pp. 3--7, Figures 2--5. \url{https://arxiv.org/abs/2009.09836v1}.
